# playCheckSound(Player player)
# Plays the "in check" sound. Fires after a move when the side-to-
# move (the side that just received the check) is currently in
# check but NOT in checkmate. Checkmate plays playCheckmateSound
# instead - the two are mutually exclusive at the interactEntity /
# play call sites.
# CHANGE the sound name below.

@using rychess
@fast

@bypass /playsound minecraft:block.cherry_wood_button.click_on master @a[x=-9134.0,y=-61.0,z=9669.0,distance=..20] -9134.0 -61.0 9669.0 1 1
